## Missing-Chemical Impact and Preparation

Ideal Hedione HC texture, exact target lavender lot, Exaltolide skin quality, Haitian vetiver, and physical evidence against barbershop or camphor drift remain gaps. Existing stocks cover this controlled direction; do not buy another lavender base, laundry floral, or musk. Verify EB before mixing and keep every tincture excluded.

## Controlled Blinded Test Plan

Compare coded equal-mass, equal-concentration LN-04 and LN-01 in balanced order at 0, 5, and 30 minutes and 2 and 4 hours. Judge cardamom authority, lavender dimensionality, lavender-to-cedar continuity, camphor/barbershop/laundry drift, and liking. No physical result exists.

## Claim Ceiling

Physical liking, sensory similarity, stability, and measured headspace are `NOT TESTED`; safety and release are `NOT CLEARED`.

